  "description": "Test support for CQRSharp, independent of any test framework: RecordingCqrsDispatcher, a fake ICqrsDispatcher that records every Send, Stream and Publish and answers with stubbed results, for unit-testing controllers and services that dispatch requests or publish notifications. The store contract suites ship separately, in CQRSharp.Testing.Xunit.V3 (xUnit v3).",
