  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 5.1.0. RecordingCqrsDispatcher records PublishAt / PublishAfter as DispatchKind.ScheduledPublish with the due time (DispatchedMessage.DueAt, ScheduledNotifications, Scheduled<T>()), and takes a TimeProvider to date PublishAfter.\n            See https://github.com/BisocM/CQRSharp/blob/v5.1.0/CHANGELOG.md for the full notes; upgrading from 5.0 needs no code or schema change.",
